//
// Update the enablement state of a custom Prometheus job by its name.\
//
// Enablement resolves per cluster:
// - `enabled` sets the default state for clusters without an explicit override.
// - `enablementByCluster` overrides `enabled` on each listed clusters.
//
// To enable a job on one cluster only, set `enabled` to `false` and override that cluster: `{"enabled": false, "enablementByCluster": {"ucp-xyz.com": true}}`.
